For one project at an International Institution, we’re urgently looking for a Full Remote Senior Oracle Database Developer. During the corona crisis, interviews will be done through WEBEX, and travel is not required for the interviews. All positions are long-term.

This role can be performed remotely from Europe. Candidates need to be fluent in English. This position is open for contractors.

Tasks and Responsibilities:

• Develop, design, modify, and implement software systems for identity management and related systems;

• Codes, tests, and debugs new and existing software per the functional and non-functional requirement, as well as business and technical requirements;

• Develop, supports and manage master data management ETL in Informatica, PL/SQL and Azure Data Factory for identity information;

• Provides T3 support for identity management in the way of data investigations, ad hoc and bulk data corrections, queries and manual updates. Covers and supplements T2 support as needed;

• Provides T3 support for Windows Active Directory user management.;

Profile:

• Bachelor or Master degree;

• +5 years of experience with Oracle DB, Oracle PL/SQL, Oracle Triggers, Java, COSMOS DB, MS SQL, Dot Net, Azure, ETL, Data modelling, application development, testing, Devops;

• Good working knowledge in (Informatica & Azure Data Factory: or similar technologies);

• Good organization and communication skills;

• Self-starter able to define requirements, resolve ambiguity, and achieve results;

• Fluent in English;

